      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EXQUISITE LASS (1) finished third (25.80) two back at Ballarat but out of the placings last time when 6th there. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Has ability and can bounce back. BICEP (7) broke from a low draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only a neck (19.62) behind Pro Warrior at this track. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Can measure up. TOTAL FURY (4) proved too good last time out claiming his maiden success at this track over 350m (19.67). Won at his only start from this box. Expecting another bold showing. MYSTIC DANCER (8) is always a threat when she races at this journey.",
